"193348":{"averageScore":63,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4ae93","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx193348-uZaAeYZeAQHW.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx193348-uZaAeYZeAQHW.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx193348-uZaAeYZeAQHW.png"},"description":"<b>Episode 1</b> - <i>Melting Under My Nephew's Touch</i><br>\nHitomi, a full-time housewife, is worried that her relationship with her husband is not going well and they have not had a child. One day, her husband's nephew, who is staying with her, offers her a massage to cheer him up, and she gives in... Unable to tell her cold husband, Hitomi wriggles her voluptuous body and becomes immersed in the pleasure her nephew brings her. As her reason melts away, where will Hitomi's desires lead her...?<br>\n<br>\n<b>Episode 2</b> - <i>My Wife's Side Job</i><br>\nYouko, in her third year of marriage, lives a modest yet energetic life while cultivating her love for her husband. In order to welcome a new family member with her beloved husband and to support the family, Youko starts working as a housekeeper. The client is a young, younger company president who lives in a luxury apartment. While Youko is enthusiastically cleaning, she breaks a USB memory stick containing important data. As an apology, the young man asks her to play the role of his \"wife\" while doing the housekeeping. He takes advantage of her guilt and makes her sleep next to him in bed, but she forgives him... Unable to quit housekeeping to support her husband who earns little, Youko's voluptuous body and reason are eaten away by the animalistic sex of the younger, handsome celebrity. And when Youko decides to quit, what choice is presented to her...?<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Mediabank, translated)","duration":20,"endDate":{"day":10,"month":10,"year":2025},"episodes":2,"favourites":47,"format":"OVA","genres":["Hentai"],"id":193348,"idMal":61788,"isAdult":true,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":65,"popularity":1029,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2025,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":12,"month":9,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","tags":[{"id":1045,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79},{"id":137,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Large Breasts","rank":79},{"id":100,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Nudity","rank":79},{"id":124,"isMediaSpoiler":true,"name":"Netorare","rank":79},{"id":279,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Ahegao","rank":20},{"id":126,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Boobjob","rank":20},{"id":1234,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Deepthroat","rank":20},{"id":134,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Fellatio","rank":20},{"id":125,"isMediaSpoiler":true,"name":"Nakadashi","rank":20}],"title":{"native":"寝取られた爆乳妻たち","romaji":"Netorareta Bakunyuu Tsuma-tachi"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793322196},
