"193623":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e47843","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx193623-t9k2EmmT8G8E.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx193623-t9k2EmmT8G8E.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx193623-t9k2EmmT8G8E.png"},"description":"Tooi, an ordinary high school girl, was expecting a normal school life—until everything changed on her very first day.\n<br><br>\nAfter catching the attention of the unpredictable and overly energetic classmate Jel, she's suddenly roped into the mysterious \"Youth Romance Club,\" a bizarre school group dedicated to chasing down anything that feels \"youthful\" or \"romantic.\"\n<br><br>\nWhat should've been a carefree club quickly spirals into chaotic antics, with Tooi constantly playing the straight man to everyone's nonsense. To make things even wilder, the club's antics start getting streamed online!\n<br><br>\nBetween laughter, unexpected twists, and even a mysterious incident, this unpredictable school life is just getting started.","duration":90,"endDate":{"day":18,"month":7,"year":2025},"episodes":1,"favourites":19,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Comedy"],"hashtag":"#遠井さん","id":193623,"idMal":61367,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":68,"popularity":1811,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2025,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":18,"month":7,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":35,"name":"Seven Arcs"}],"synonyms":["遠井さん","Tooi-san"],"tags":[{"id":46,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"School","rank":20}],"title":{"native":"遠井さんは青春したい！『バカとスマホとロマンスと』","romaji":"Tooi-san wa Seishun Shitai! \"Baka to SmaPho to Romance to\""},"trailer":{"id":"RGmXxWKPx6Y","site":"youtube"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793266146},
